*~
*#
*.swp
*.tmp
*.bak
.env
*.env
*.log
bin
testout
dist
man
# SQLite does not version well in git -- a fresh binary blob per commit and
# no readable diff -- and `kb` with no --db creates ./agents/knowledge.db in
# whatever directory it is run from, so running it inside this repo silently
# leaves an untracked database that `git add -A` would sweep into a commit.
# The WAL siblings were already ignored here; the database itself was not.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.pre-*
